sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Human
  participant Host as AI host
  participant Agent as Agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant P as Policy/approval
  participant X as Execution
  H->>Host: Declare purpose and request
  Host->>Agent: Delegation context
  Agent->>G: Proposed action
  G->>P: Preflight policy
  P-->>G: Approval required
  G-->>Host: MRTR approval request
  H->>Host: Approve bounded action
  Host->>G: Approval evidence
  G->>P: Issue transaction permit
  G->>X: Execute permitted action
  X-->>G: Result and evidence
  G-->>Host: Result and receipt
